WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:03.480
Blue sky! White clouds!

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.060
Summertime means...

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.770
...beach time!

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.800
Wow, it's cold!

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.160
Hurry up, everyone!

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.850
C'mon, you're getting too excited.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:27.220
Gotta say, I'm impressed you found this place.

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:30.520
We've almost got it all to ourselves.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.360
Well, you see...

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.050
Something touched my leg!

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.520
Sheesh, don't scare me like that.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.360
This beach is famous as a haunted place.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:54.910
Tell us that sooner!

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.750
Now that's a good haul.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:06.030
I wanna go home! No!

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.140
Summertime means beach time!

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:44.470
Why don't we go hit the beach
during summer break?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.980
The beach?

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:50.660
It <i>has</i> been really hot lately.

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:54.860
I'd like to go, but if we go that far,
won't we need a chaperon?

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:58.480
You get really serious about
the strangest things, Inoue.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:02:59.240
What of it?

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:05.740
And what's with you?!

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:07.970
We're all set there.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.250
Do you know someone?

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.210
My big brother...

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.670
The police officer!

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:15.170
And he's <i>your</i> brother?!

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:17.670
So this is...

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:19.350
my big brother!

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:20.130
Hi, everyone!

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:22.560
Nice to meet you.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:25.090
Thank you for coming today.

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:27.640
I didn't expect him to be so laid-back.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.390
What's wrong, Esumi?

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:33.120
Look at all the spunky high school girls!

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.210
I wish I could take one of you home with me,

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.650
but it's against the law, so no hope of that!

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:42.180
He's well-known for being an open book.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.530
They're definitely brothers!

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.910
So you have a white swimsuit, Amami?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:50.620
Yes.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:55.320
Got a little adventurous, didn't you?
Check out that navel.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.010
I think you look great!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.670
Thank you.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.590
We went to pick them out together for today.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.840
I picked out a few for you.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.580
Thank you.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.380
Here are your choices!

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:13.730
That angle!

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:16.230
Leopard print?

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:18.610
String?!

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.110
Good.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.730
Th-That one's perfectly normal.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.570
You don't have to act so bashful.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.120
Right!

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.500
Let's get a shot to remember this by.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.130
They're all the way out here, too?!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:48.230
She has impregnable ghost photo defenses.

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:52.770
But you know, some might say...

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.270
Having them there to cover her...

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:56.770
...makes it look even sexier!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.170
Look at all the fish!

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:10.090
The water's pretty deep, huh?

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:12.600
It's kinda scary that we
can see down to the bottom.

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:15.580
Hello!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.880
Something's down there!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.050
What was she talking to?!

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:28.640
Bet ya didn't expect to see me here!

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:33.640
I'm gonna take full advantage
of your being distracted.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:36.140
What?

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.610
Buzz off.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:46.070
Cut it out already!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.300
What the hell are you guys?!

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:58.730
Here it comes!

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.210
And... there!

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:03.670
O-Okay!

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.670
Don't hit that thing to me!

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.070
Coming back!

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:10.040
No more!

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:13.350
Esumi, what's with you today?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.060
You're being so reclusive.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:16.600
It's nothing...

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:25.280
Oh? What's this?

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.870
I hope he doesn't remember...

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.630
What'd you do back in the day?

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.750
And what are you doing right now?!

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:46.150
Underwater might be off limits...

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.520
But they can't lay a finger on me in this boat!

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:51.720
Summer in Japan is gonna be the
summer of sexual harassment!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.660
Hey!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.800
That's against the rules!

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.360
Let's split a watermelon!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.140
Yay!

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.540
You too! C'mon!

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:17.660
What's up?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:20.740
Oh, uh, it's nothing...

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:23.170
<i>Did he forget?</i>

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:27.500
I wonder how a watermelon
split by a high school girl tastes.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.170
<i>Thank goodness he's a moron.</i>

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:32.180
Huh? Um...

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.100
Go for it, Amami!

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:36.670
Okay...

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.860
Um...

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:52.120
I call foul.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:53.910
We know it's you, roll-call samurai!

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:56.720
Yum!

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:57.190
So good!
Yum!

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.140
So good!

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.700
So you're the girl with the sixth sense?

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:02.790
Oh, yes.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:05.750
Can you predict the future, too?

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.200
The future?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.130
No, I'm afraid not.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:15.500
Really? Well, it's still cool that
you can see ghosts and stuff!

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:19.140
It's like you've got a superpower.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:24.230
Doesn't that seem like the kind
of power a hero would have?

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.230
A hero, you say?

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.170
Yes, a hero!

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:35.030
Every little boy wishes he could be
a hero at some point in his life.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.870
I was no different!

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:38.810
But...

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.170
I didn't have any powers...

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:45.380
Um...

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:46.250
That's why...

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:51.550
I decided to become a hero
using the powers of the law!

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:55.640
Stupid brother is stupid.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.450
Well...

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:05.020
I can't predict the future, but I can ask the locals
if there's been any suspicious activity.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.980
The locals?

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.980
The thing in the paper!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:16.470
I got some great info!

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:18.870
First of all,

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:23.750
ride the train home leaving at 7:18 PM.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:25.750
And secondly,

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:29.880
look out the train window at that cliff,

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.460
and you'll see a very interesting sight.

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:36.600
Would you say...

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:40.560
it's a more interesting sight than I am?!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.950
No more schemes!

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:53.110
Direct assault!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.500
Whoa, wha— Stop!
Stop that! Hey!

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:12.260
Ready to call it a day?

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:13.720
Aww...

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:15.630
Well, this was only a day trip, after all.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.400
We've gotta make that 7:18 train.

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:20.640
Oh, yeah.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:24.640
Okay... Then let's stay the night next time.

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:31.000
C'mon, we're leaving.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:33.990
Give me just a second.

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:35.150
What are you doing?

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.720
Asking for advice on souvenirs.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.380
What is that?

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:45.120
What?!

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.560
Pink heart-shaped shells!

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.000
Wow...

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.810
Looks like they were eroded into this shape.

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:00.130
They're beautiful.

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:02.410
Look, we match.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:05.940
Take it back!

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:07.310
No...

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.520
Shut up!

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.390
Thank you very much.

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:19.400
Thank you very much!

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:22.320
You're not joining in?

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.780
I-I'll do it later.

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:34.040
Okay, we're on the 7:18 train home!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.200
I wonder what'll happen...

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:43.120
<i>I've never thought of my
sixth sense as a superpower.</i>

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.960
The cliff will be there when we exit the tunnel.

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:50.310
We just need to look at it out the window, right?

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:54.140
<i>But if it brings a smile to someone's face...</i>

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:03.410
A local fireworks show?

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.490
Perfect timing!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:07.370
How is she always right?

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.920
Amami, you're amazing!

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.790
Wait, what was so interesting about the cliff?

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:17.300
What's this place so famous for?

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:29.300
Not convincing at all!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.370
I guess I'll call her about tomorrow.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:48.680
Hello? Amami?

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:50.640
You have reached the voicemail service.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:52.400
She's not home?

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.790
Please leave your message after the tone.

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:58.620
I'm right behind you, listening.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:05.220
Answer your damn phone!

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.170
Huh?

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.270
Is everything okay?

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:15.790
You seem down.

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:18.060
Ah, sort of...

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:21.170
But I'll get over it.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.780
Hey, Flame-Haired Messiah!

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.780
Is she over it?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:37.050
Um, Flame-Haired—

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.890
Don't repeat it!

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:41.290
It's finally been brought into the light, huh?

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:46.800
Flame-Haired Messiah was Esumi's street name

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.800
in her gangster days!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.980
I said, don't repeat that!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.430
More like a flame-haired demon!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:02.980
Remember when we met Yamada's
older brother over summer break?

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.880
I actually knew him back then.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.360
What?!

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:09.640
Since I'm your chaperon...

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:10.900
He pretended he didn't remember me,

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:11.410
I'll need all of your email addresses!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.160
and got our email addresses...

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:13.950
I'll need all of your email addresses!

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:16.900
And then he sent me a fan letter!

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.410
<i>What kind of relationship did they have?!</i>

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.880
Here's a shot of her from back then.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:26.550
Don't show them that.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:30.380
Esumi was a legend in her own right.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.050
And don't start telling stories.

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:37.600
What should we do tonight?

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.960
Eh, whatever.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.350
Uh, um...

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:44.690
Come with us.

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:47.640
Sorry, something came up.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:49.700
Yeah, okay.

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:54.870
Um... Please, just stop!

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:58.150
Hey, what's the big deal?

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:00.000
Hang out with us.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:01.440
'Kay?

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:03.880
No way!

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.760
Somebody help me!

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.300
What the—

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:18.390
Cut the crap, you scum!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:19.850
Who's there?!

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.990
Red hair like flames...

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.130
You can't be...

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:30.940
The almighty Flame-Haired Messiah!

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:34.990
Don't call me that!

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:42.000
So as she rescued the weak and crushed the strong,

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:45.240
Esumi became a legend.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.520
And she lived happily ever after.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.250
There's no happy ending here.

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:53.570
But... "Flame-Haired Messiah"?

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:56.240
People just started calling me that!

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:05.980
Me... Messi... Messiah!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.090
Messiah!

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:09.020
Just laugh out loud already.

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:13.570
Well, everyone has things in their past
that they find hard to talk about.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.450
Even you, Ogawa?

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.380
Tell us!

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:17.620
No way!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:22.350
I bet Amami has some stories like that!

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:24.940
Any embarrassing tales from your past?

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:25.620
Huh?

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:30.670
What? Amami's embarrassing stories?

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:36.650
I, Yoshida, have kept my notepad on my person
24/7 in anticipation of just such an event.

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:38.490
All for my new manga!

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:40.560
No, that doesn't matter!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.670
I wanna hear about Amami's
embarrassing moments!

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:46.810
Now, out with it! Spill! Out with it already!

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:52.940
Well... When I was little...

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:54.510
Uh-huh?

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.730
It's embarrassing to say,

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:02.160
but I got so lonely at night, I couldn't sleep alone.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.960
Ah, that's common.

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:09.090
But then everyone came and stayed with me.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:10.580
Hi!

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:13.860
It's okay. Don't be scared.

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.170
Would you like to talk for a while?

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.300
Okay!

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:23.430
It's still a wonderful memory for me.

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.310
I take back what I said.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:34.570
They'd even hold my hands until I finally fell asleep.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:38.030
Thank goodness it didn't turn into eternal slumber.

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:43.430
Hands...

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:47.540
That reminds me, I had a spiritual
encounter back then, too.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:48.500
For real?

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:49.660
Yeah.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:53.830
I was in a fight in this alley...

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:01.490
Damn you!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:03.100
Don't mess with us!

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:06.400
S-Save me...

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:10.480
Please... Save me!

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.440
This way!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.520
Stop right there!

00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:16.440
Outta the way!

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.260
Hey, you all right?

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.570
W-Weren't you scared?

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:57.240
Nah.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:01.930
Back then, people scared me more than ghosts did.

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.200
So after that...

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.640
Hey, you there!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.720
Messiah?

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:18.130
You're Messiah, right?

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:21.720
I've finally met <i>the</i> Flame-Haired Messiah!

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:28.810
Man, I hear rumors about a heroic
young girl all the time at the station!

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:33.140
I became a police officer because
I wanted to be a hero, you know?

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:37.820
I never would've believed it if I hadn't met you!

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:42.700
I've been wanting to meet you forever,
but I've had zero luck.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.640
Every time I heard that Messiah was nearby,

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:47.190
I rushed out to the scene.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:51.790
You don't know how happy I am to meet you!

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:56.170
Hey, do you think we could
exchange numbers and emails?

00:19:56.850 --> 00:20:00.590
Oh, but first, I've got to get a shot of us together.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:03.050
Say "cheese!"

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:08.350
People can be punched,
and I'm damn glad about that.

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:10.850
Bro!

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:19.230
So, well, it's like...

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:27.110
If there's a hand there that no one notices but me...

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.370
Then before I can think about it...

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:36.100
I just take hold of it.

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:08.470
So I can understand, sort of.

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:10.650
Esumi...

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:16.650
Another email!

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:19.590
You're too polite. You could just ignore him.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:22.570
If I don't respond, he'll come for me in person!

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:24.610
He already has!

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:28.930
Hey.

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:35.820
Seeing her responding to him makes it seem like the ghost arm brought them together.

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:38.900
Damn it...

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:42.400
Indeed!

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.320
What a pain.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:05.190
I was trying to avenge my own death by turning that punk in!

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.980
Do your job, you dumb cop!

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:43.760
Hey. It's Esumi Kyouko.

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:46.100
Amami and the gang had a good time,

00:23:46.100 --> 00:23:47.900
so it was a good summer break.

00:23:48.220 --> 00:23:51.110
But I'll never forgive the Yamada brothers!

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:55.790
I think I'll help get ready for the culture
festival to get myself in a better mood.

00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:58.180
What's our class gonna do?

00:23:58.180 --> 00:24:00.620
That's a silly question.

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:02.050
Next time on Re-Kan!:

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:04.210
"The Legendary Culture Festival."

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:06.920
Hey, you! The one who just said "Messiah"!

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:08.340
Step outside with me for a sec.
